00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.200
Mark and Ethan: Get eaten by a giant fucking hamster

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.240
Mark: Like a giant 'fucking hamster'.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.500
Ethan: "What happens on the tour bus stays in the tour bus. Elaborate?"

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.360
I think that we should do the tour bus.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:32.020
Mark: all in favor of the tour bus say 'aye'.

00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:32.600
