00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.100
and then I will write for three minutes, and then Tyler will write for three minutes

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:37.800
using the last sentence that I wrote.
We won't know what each other writes

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:41.200
